#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
dotnet is the .NET SDK and runtime.

This plugin installs .NET SDKs directly with Microsoft's official
dotnet-install.sh script. Select an SDK with .tool-versions:

  dotnet 8.0.426

global.json is supported when legacy_version_file = yes is set in
~/.asdfrc. The plugin reads the sdk.version value from global.json.

For editors, language servers, and global tools that do not run through
the asdf shim, run the command with the selected SDK's environment.

On asdf 0.20+:

  asdf cmd dotnet exec -- <command> [args...]
  eval "$(asdf cmd dotnet env)"

On asdf 0.14-0.19:

  asdf dotnet exec <command> [args...]
  eval "$(asdf dotnet env)"
EOF
